  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/12/IMG_4030.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(40 fotos) Pap&aacute; Noel ha visitado hasta en tres ocasiones la piscina municipal de Onda, para saludar y repartir caramelos a todos los ni&ntilde;os y todas las ni&ntilde;as que siguen los cursos de nataci&oacute;n, tanto las tardes laborables como la ma&ntilde;ana del s&aacute;bado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3986.jpg\" alt=\"img_3986\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3987.jpg\" alt=\"img_3987\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3988.jpg\" alt=\"img_3988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3990.jpg\" alt=\"img_3990\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3991.jpg\" alt=\"img_3991\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3992.jpg\" alt=\"img_3992\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3993.jpg\" alt=\"img_3993\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3994.jpg\" alt=\"img_3994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/parenoelvisitapiscina16/img_3995.jpg\" alt=\"img_3995\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91